# Prettier reads only the `.prettierignore` in its own CWD, so the repo-root
# one does NOT protect a run started from this directory — `bun run format`
# here (this workspace has its own script), or a bare `prettier --write .`.
# Without this file that run expands `public/_sdk/plugin-sdk.js`, a minified
# artifact checked into the repo, from one line into 216 and dirties the tree.
#
# Anything the root file ignores under `apps/terminal/` belongs here too, minus
# the prefix. `src/__tests__/prettierignore-parity.test.ts` fails if they drift.

# Build artifacts checked into the repo — plugin-sdk.js ships minified.
public/_sdk/

# Pyodide core assets, staged out of node_modules by a Vite plugin.
public/_pyodide/

# Build output. Nothing under a dist/ is tracked, and rewriting a bundle the
# dev server is serving is a bad trade for formatting nobody reads.
dist/
